# Purpose: prepare D3 only: stop reading the legacy bearer secret and send
# AgentStack Mail MCP requests without an Authorization header.
# Apply after 0002: AGENTSTACK_MCP_URL remains required, so a leftover legacy
# environment cannot hide a missing new endpoint selector (startup fails closed).
# Cutover consequence: after D3, dashboard register/send cannot use legacy 8765.
# Rollback: reverse this patch before pointing AGENTSTACK_MCP_URL back at 8765;
# that restores the legacy bearer reader/header. Reverting only the URL is broken.
# D4/D5 retire and owner-token behavior are intentionally unchanged.
# Apply only after a strict dry-run from /Users/operator:
# patch --batch --forward --fuzz=0 --no-backup-if-mismatch -p1 < 0003-dashboard-agentstack-mail-no-bearer.patch
